    "short_description": "Born In Reverie is a slow burn, narrative heavy RPG. Experience Dani and the Guardians' story as they defend their home from the Beasts. Delve deep into the mountains to fight the beastly scourge, explore Dani's peculiar dreams, and discover the reason to keep moving forward.",
